{"hw":"χραύω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">χραύω</h4>*<span class=\"lex-orth gk\">χραύω</span> (this <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> implied by <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐνέχραυε,</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> v. ἐγχραύω ), <b class=\"lex-tr\">scrape, graze, wound slightly,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ὅν ῥά τε ποιμὴν.. χραύσῃ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.138</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἵνα χραύσαντα δαΐξῃ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Q.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.76</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἔχραυσεν,</span> glossed by <span class=\"gk\">ἐπέτυχεν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span> c. gen., of lands, <b class=\"lex-tr\">touch, be adjacent to,</b> <span class=\"gk\">χραυόμενον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Inscr.Cypr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">135.9</span> </span> H.; also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">χραυζόμενον</span> ib. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18</span> </span>.</div></div>"}